      "boundary": "File coordination, NSFileVersion and iCloud's download of an evicted file are the OS's; a timed-out download is an error, never absence. The decision inside the coordinated block is held by tables. iCloud offers no server-side condition, so a later upload from another device can still land after the check. Conflict versions are read and resolved in one coordinated block; which to resolve is the settings store's (`settingsWrite`), and only versions named by their bytes are resolved."
    },
